'''Masked Okame''' (阿亀我王, ''Okame Gaō'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Hannya]] first seen in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[The Pure Land (Merciless)|Courts of Torment]]. She was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Masked Okame
|image = E 491.png
|appearance = [[The Pure Land (Merciless)|Courts of Torment]]<br>[[Courts of Agony]]<br>[[Rank-Up Test 3 (Rank 12)|Catclaw Championships Rank 12]]
|money drop = 4,500¢ - 17,775¢
}}

==Enemy==
Though she resembles Hannya in more ways than one, Masked Okame has plenty of differences and is overall tougher than her predecessor. While she inflicts less damage than Hannya, she has more than double the health with only one knockback, attacks almost twice as frequently, and possesses long-ranged [[Omni Strike]] attacks with a 100% chance of [[Knockback|knockback]] and [[Immune to Freeze|freeze immunity]]. She has only one weakness: as a Red and Dark hybrid enemy, there are a wide range of units that might be effective against her, assuming they're sturdy, [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|immune to knockback]], outrange her, or are a [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] unit.

==Strategy==
:''See [[The Pure Land (Merciless)]], [[Heaven and Hell (Merciless)]], [[Okame's Teahouse (Merciless)]], and [[Rank-Up Test 3 (Rank 12)]] for each stage's strategy.''

